{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14540","headline":"过贾谊旧居 · 戴叔伦","name":"过贾谊旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚乡卑湿叹殊方，鵩赋人非宅已荒。\n谩有长书忧汉室，空将哀些吊沅湘。\n雨余古井生秋草，叶尽疎林见夕阳。\n过客不须频太息，咸阳宫殿亦凄凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}